soulkiller-no-soul = There is no personality left in this brain to extract.
soulkiller-target-alive = The brain is still fighting. The soulkiller only works on the dying and the dead.
soulkiller-extract-start = The soulkiller digs into the nervous system and starts reading the personality.
soulkiller-extracted = The personality has been written onto the chip: {$name}.
soulkiller-victim = You are pulled deep into digital noise. Your body is left behind.

engram-chip-name = engram chip ({$name})
engram-chip-empty = The chip is empty.
engram-appeared = A flickering hologram fades in next to you. The engram sees the world through your eyes.

uplink-soulkiller-name = Soulkiller
uplink-soulkiller-desc = Rips the personality out of a dying or dead brain and writes it onto a chip. Install the chip into yourself and the victim's engram will appear next to you, seen and heard only by you. You can carry any number of engrams, and they all see and hear each other. The victim's body is left an empty shell.
